ning whether Nikke rights are really being respected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_7","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_7","text":"With that, the Goddess Fall incident is thrust back into the public eye, reshaping how everyone sees Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_8","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_8","text":"Riding the momentum of Pretty's rise, the Nikke Rights Committee grows in power,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_9","text":"while the Nikkephobes become bolder and more extreme in their actions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_10","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_10","text":"Around this time, Mustang, CEO of Tetra Line, makes a major announcement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Stage","bgArt":"stage","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["mustang_past"],"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_11","text":"At Tetra Line, we actively defend the rights of every Nikke!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_trueentertainment","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_12","text":"They are not mere heartless weapons!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_13","text":"Non, they are comrades... liés to march forward with us!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_14","text":"En avant! With Nikke!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_15","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_15","text":"Riding the wave of Pretty's popularity, Tetra Line launches the With Nikke campaign.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_16","text":"They hand full control to the Nikke Rights Committee, taking a step back to sponsor it while solidifying their own corporate identity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_17","text":"Infrastructure and support systems for Nikkes are built, and those facing persecution receive active care.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_18","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_18","text":"Hostility toward the Nikkephobes is no longer hidden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_19","text":"From that day on, Pretty becomes the public face of the Nikke Rights Committee,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_20","text":"and the With Nikke campaign spreads across the Ark like wildfire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_21","text":"Of course, it doesn't come without consequences.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["mrsmiss"],"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_22","text":"Mustang, have you completely lost it? What do you think you're doing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_empathize","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_23","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_24","text":"The Central Government isn't just going to sit back and watch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_25","text":"One of the Big Three openly picking a fight with the Nikkephobes? What do you think that'll accomplish?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_26","text":"They need the Nikkephobes, since it's the perfect tool for covering up their own mess.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_27","text":"Old age catching up to you? Looks like you've lost your edge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_28","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_29","text":"Does it matter to the Central Government whether people hate scrap metals or worship them? Not a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_30","text":"All that matters is that they don't get blamed for anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_31","text":"Look at this mess, the haters and supporters tearing each other apart,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_32","text":"while the fence-sitters are too busy watching the circus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_33","text":"Do you think the Central Government has time to get involved? No, they're way too busy for that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_34","text":"Even if the supporters come out on top, the government doesn't lose a thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_35","text":"All they have to do is act like they're looking out for us, and the self-proclaimed intellectuals will lap it up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_36","text":"As for past scandals? Easy, just grab someone, make an example of them in the square, and problem solved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_37","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_38","text":"Sure, I was uneasy too. The last thing I needed was trouble from the Central Government,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_39","text":"but it's all taken care of, so relax.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_40","text":"You cut a deal with them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_41","text":"Remember those rust buckets gearing up for their debut?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_42","text":"Yeah, they're already in an uproar over Pretty cutting in line, and now there's more?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_43","text":"Heh, don't worry. That's the last you'll see of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_44","text":"You don't mean...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_45","text":"Kitted them out with the best parts money can buy and sent one to each of the top brass. They'll be thrilled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_46","text":"And if anyone thinks of messing with us, we've got leverage ready to keep them in check.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_48","text":"And if that doesn't work, we can always send Shade to slit their throats.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_49","text":"It's not exactly rocket science.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_50","text":"Do you even realize who these girls are?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_51","text":"I raised them myself, with meticulous care!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_52","text":"Yeah, and I raised them on my dime. So they owe it all to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_53","text":"Even when they pay me back, they get something out of it. Beautiful, isn't it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_54","text":"You disgust me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_55","text":"You've got some nerve, talking to me like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_56","text":"Forget about the dead weights and focus on Pretty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_57","text":"Forget her dancing and singing. Just make sure she's presentable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_58","text":"Image is everything. Make her a symbol everyone will remember.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_59","text":"That's exactly what I'm doing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_60","text":"And give her a taste of power and wealth.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_62","text":"Praise her, indulge her, get her addicted to the high life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_63","text":"Make sure she never even thinks of going back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_64","text":"What exactly are you trying to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_65","text":"This is just in case. It'd be a real pain if she suddenly decides she doesn't care about fame or money.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_66","text":"There's no way we're letting a prize like this slip away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_67","text":"Make luxury part of her life, turn her into a celebrity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_68","text":"Got it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_69","text":"... Fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_70","text":"But Mustang,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"mrsmiss","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_71","text":"you're going to hell.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_72","text":"Damn right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_73","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_73","text":"As the company sponsoring Pretty and the With Nikke campaign, Tetra Line's stocks keep surging as it gains a pro-Nikke image.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_74","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_74","text":"At the center of it all, Pretty is stretched thin under the relentless workload.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Side_05_03","bgArt":"eventscene_side_05_03","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_75","text":"Ughhh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_cottoncandy","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_76","text":"I'm sooo exhausted!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_77","text":"Don't sprawl out like that. What if someone takes a picture?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_78","text":"It's all good! They tinted it, remember?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_79","text":"But a thermal camera would capture everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_80","text":"Yeah, yeah, let them film. It's not like I ever get a break anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_81","text":"Next up's the talk show, right? Three hours this time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_82","text":"That's right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_83","text":"I've got the script down pat. Now I just need to decide where to throw in some improv.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_84","text":"You really do work hard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_85","text":"I know this is a bit out of the blue, but why do you push yourself so hard?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_86","text":"Hey, Hanson, have you ever seen the Goddess Squad in person?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_87","text":"Hmm... No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_88","text":"Hehe, I have!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_89","text":"... What? When?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_90","text":"I remember seeing them as a kid during the Ark evacuation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_91","text":"I even have Red Hood's autograph at home.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_92","text":"That's amazing... I can hardly believe it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_93","text":"I'm not making this up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_94","text":"Anyway, that's exactly why I work so hard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_95","text":"I want to give people hope, just like the Goddess Squad did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_96","text":"Sometimes, just being there, just being seen, is enough to lift people's spirits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_97","text":"That's the kind of person I want to be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_98","text":"And the more I give my all, the more I see that life is getting better for the Nikkes. So how could I ever slack off?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_99","text":"Still, it's rare these days to come across anyone who's Nikkephobic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_100","text":"Yeah, that's such a relief.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_101","text":"It's all thanks to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_102","text":"No way! It's really all thanks to the staff, Mrs. Miss, and a certain director-slash-manager.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_103","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_104","text":"Hmm... Looks like I'll be getting home at dawn again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_105","text":"Mister's probably still up... Ugh, I feel awful about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_106","text":"Isn't it time for Mr. Oswald to retire soon?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_107","text":"Nah, he says he can't sit still without his mind going a mile a minute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_108","text":"You said you'd ask what was on his mind. Did you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_109","text":"Noooo! His expression was so serious and stern that I couldn't even bring myself to ask.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_06_110","text":"Sounds like there's something going on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_06_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"pre